Package: CANOPE
Type: Package
Title: Copy-number Analysis using Normalized Observation Profiling for Exomes
Version: 0.3.0
Author: TL
Maintainer: TL <lavauxt@gmail.com>
Description: An R package for detecting copy number variations (CNVs) in targeted and exome sequencing data using low-variance reference sample selection and hidden Markov modeling. Results are summarised in a standalone, interactive, multi-sample HTML report with QC and chromosome-coverage warnings. Report, QC, outlier removal, logging and VCF export share their code with the ECHO package, and an opt-in targets pipeline caches the BAM counting.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
